{
 "id": "nt-180",
 "titre": "New Testament reading plan",
 "sous": "180 days · 6 months · 260 chapters",
 "intro": [
  "Follow the plan day by day: Day 1, Day 2… up to Day 180. No dates: start whenever you want.",
  "The books are not read in Bible order. We start with the most gripping stories, then the short letters, then the longer books, and finally the densest content.",
  "Every 7th day is a catch-up day (Days 7, 14, 21…): no new reading. Catch up on a delay or re-read a passage that touched you.",
  "There are 155 reading days left, about 1 to 2 chapters per day: allow 10 to 15 minutes.",
  "If you miss a day, don’t be discouraged: pick up where you stopped and use the next catch-up day."
 ],
